// Failure golden: an eliminator answer type naming a value type.
//
// The slot is the eliminator's constant motive, and `if` answers with a
// computation, so `Integer` is the wrong category. The lowerer declines it by
// name rather than repairing it into the returner `F Integer` -- repairing it
// would put a type in the term that the source never wrote.
if true -> Integer { ret 1 } else { ret 2 }

